loom parity=sorted_multiset rungs=8 differing_lines=0 ordered_diff_min=4 ordered_diff_max=16 self_vs_self_ordered=14
file caravan/ladder_checks.rye tell_desist_runs lifted once as a comptime body over the pair of words, the one raw reach named in its doc
file caravan/conclude.rye fifty-line body to a one-line delegate; nine accessors widened by one word
file caravan/farewell.rye same fold, words quiet and parting
file caravan/answer.rye same fold, words leaving and hearing
file caravan/refrain.rye same fold, words calling and refraining
file caravan/respect.rye same fold, words reopening and respecting
file caravan/beckon.rye same fold, words keeping and beckoning
file caravan/abate.rye same fold, words holding and abating
file caravan/desist.rye same fold, words relaying and bounding; below_of widened as a tenth symbol
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_print_scan.sh ceiling lowered 3100 to 2800 so the fold stays folded
file tools/caravan_ladder_print_witness.rish meters repinned from measurement, every prose number moved with them
file caravan/README.md fold K recorded, and the spent claim corrected from the wider meter in the same commit
file crux/REMEMBER.md live edge rotated to fold K, folds I and J condensed to a pointer, Now refilled with the measured next crux
recommend keep-going stand_taking_and_returning_reach stands in 42 of 44 rungs at thirty-five lines apiece under one hash -- 1,435 carried, the largest single fold this arc has had, and its shape is already measured. Verify the reached symbols are pub across all forty-two before a line moves, as every fold here has done.
